   "widgets_values": [
    "## Low memory · step 2 of 2\nRun **standrig_lowmem_1_sheets** first with the same `project` name. This step loads the exact source canvas and the expression layers it saved (no Qwen model is loaded here), runs See-through with low-memory settings and writes `character.psd`, then updates the same reference-manifest.json with the PSD's hash and frees memory."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
